  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;Fire in your hands is not metaphor.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>Cleansing Breath.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as an action: exhale a 15-ft cone of radiant fire. Each creature in the cone makes an <strong>Evasion</strong> save (<strong>DC = 10 + your Presence + Soul</strong>); on failure they take <strong>2d10 sephirotic</strong> damage, half on success. The die pool scales with Tier: +1d10 at Tier 2, +2d10 at Tier 3, +3d10 at Tier 4. Exploding dice apply normally and bank Surge per RFI convention.</p>",
